    "body": "I think this is fine. I'd still want to also change the \"top-layer-add\" algorithm to not move things around, but instead assert that the element to add is not in the top layer currently. It seems to me the HTML spec doesn't allow a open dialog to be opened again, so it wouldn't break that assertion either.",
